  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong>Chimerism Status</strong></span></th>\n<th><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong>Interpretation</strong></span></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong>Complete Donor Chimerism</strong></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">100% donor cells &ndash; Indicates full engraftment.</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong>Mixed Chimerism</strong></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Presence of both donor and recipient DNA &ndash; Monitor for graft stability or relapse.</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong>Decreasing Donor Chimerism</strong></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Declining donor percentage &ndash; May suggest graft rejection or relapse.</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong>Increasing Recipient Chimerism</strong></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Sign of disease recurrence or graft failure.</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 data-start=\"2787\" data-end=\"2802\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2802\">Remarks</strong></span></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"2804\" data-end=\"3102\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2804\" data-end=\"2890\">\n<p data-start=\"2806\" data-end=\"2890\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">This is a <strong data-start=\"2816\" data-end=\"2841\">quantitative analysis</strong>; minor fluctuations may occur post-transplant.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2891\" data-end=\"2988\">\n<p data-start=\"2893\" data-end=\"2988\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"2893\" data-end=\"2914\">Serial monitoring</strong> is recommended at regular intervals to assess stability of engraftment.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2989\" data-end=\"3102\">\n<p data-start=\"2991\" data-end=\"3102\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Interpretation should be done in clinical context, especially if <strong data-start=\"3056\" data-end=\"3088\">immunosuppression or relapse</strong> is suspected.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
